title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer += 6; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: year >= 1930 and streetfighting_timer = 0 and sa_strength >= 150 and not return_to_normalcy 
card-image: img/blutmai_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

With the dismal state of the economy, civil unrest is brewing and many of the unemployed turn to paramilitary groups. Battles rage on the streets between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span>, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Stahlhelm**</span>, <span style="color: #8B0000;">**RFB**</span>, and the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Reichsbanner**</span> nearly every day. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing civil war levels, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We cannot sit idly and watch these extremists slaughter innocents in the streets. 

# - @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the fascists!
- @para_urgency: Push the party towards a more militant defense of the current constitutional order
- @z_endorse_rb: We must take up arms in the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Reichsbanner**</span> to defend the streets from the <span style="color: #700000;">far left</span> and <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>
- @prussian_police_training: Use the Prussian police to help train the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Reichsbanner**</span>.
- @bw: We can fund the <span style="color: #0094FF;">Bayernwacht</span>, the <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP's**</span> regional paramilitary. 
- @police: Turn to the state police to crack down on the paramilitaries
- @easy_discard

@para_urgency
view-if: streetfighting_urgency = 0  
subtitle: Most of the party is unwilling to wade into the fray.
on-arrival: streetfighting_urgency += 1
max-visits: 1

Pictures and anecdotes from the party rank-and-file tell the tale of chaos and bloodshed in the streets. They plead for us to do something, anything, to restore law and order. Faced with such visceral appeals from the people, we are forced to take drastic action. 

@z_endorse_rb
subtitle: This would entail an official endorsement of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Reichsbanner**</span>
view-if: streetfighting_urgency = 1 
choose-if: pro_republic <= 60 and nsdap_votes >= 10 and (left_strength + center_strength) >= 1.25*(right_strength) and left_strength > 20 and spd_relation >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: [? if pro_republic > 60 : The situation is not desperate enough. ?][? if (left_strength + center_strength) < 1.25*(right_strength) : The <span style="color: #000000;">Catholic Conservatives</span> can block this from happening. ?][? if left_strength <= 20 : The party has ignored this proposal from the <span style="color: #FF7F00;">Christian Left</span>. ?][? if spd_relation >= 55 : Many in the party distrust the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>. ?]
go-to: endorse_rb

@prussian_police_training
view-if: spd_prussia == 1 and z_prussia == 1 and prussian_police_loyalty > 0.5
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.05; sa_strength += 50; prussian_police_training += 1

The loyal sections of the Prussian police can help train the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Reichsbanner**</span>.

@bw
choose-if: bvp_reunified = 1 and resources > 0 and year >= 1931 
unavailable_subtitle: [? if bvp_reunified = 0 : The <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span> does not need our help. ?][? if resources = 0 : Not enough resources ?][? if year <= 1930 : The <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span> thinks that it is a waste of money. ?]
view-if: streetfighting_urgency = 1 
on-arrival: bw_militancy += 0.065; bw_strength += 2.5; resources -= 1

In these trying times, the <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span> is grateful for any bit of aid we can offer

@police
choose-if: z == prussia or bvp_reunfied = 0
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in any major state governments.
on-arrival: prussian_police_strength += 5 if z == prussia; sa_strength -= 1; rfb_strength -= 1

This is an amenable compromise for all factions of the party and prepares the state police for further encounters on the streets. 
